<title>USA: Ascent names Robert Schwartz chairman.</title>
<headline>Ascent names Robert Schwartz chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascent Entertainment Group Inc said Wednesday that its board named Robert Schwartz chairman, succeeding C.J. Silas, who resigned in April for what Ascent said were health reasons.</p>
<p>Schwartz has been a member of Ascent's board since December 1995, when the company became a public corporation. Additionally, Ascent said its board appointed Alan Korobov, who has been controller of Comsat Corp since November 1995, to fill the board vacancy created by Silas' resignation.</p>
</text>
